    <measure number="63" width="248.41">
      <direction placement="below">
        <direction-type>
          <words default-y="-40.00" relative-x="7.09" relative-y="-35.00">You know, Hanukkah is not a time for going caroling and hanging stockings.
</words>
          <words>It's the time for making noises with the shofars and this is shocking.
</words>
          <words>It's for reciting the Hallel hymn and reading out the torah.
</words>
          <words>If you're tired of these non jewish holidays, just do the horah.
</words>
          <words>Scarlett Johannson's one of them, and you are too.
</words>
          <words>But there are a lot of typical ways that we describe a jew.
</words>
          <words>Another one of these traditions is gelt, which is coin shaped money.
</words>
          <words>And get these types of food to your honey…
</words>
          <words>t</words>
          </direction-type>
        </direction>
      <note>
        <rest measure="yes"/>
        <duration>8</duration>
        <voice>1</voice>
        </note>
      </measure>
